---
layout: layout.njk
title: "whatis.foundation"
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-16 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
  <div class="space-y-6 text-center">
    <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-brand-600">Sacred learning path</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">whatis.foundation</h1>
    <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">
      A sacred educational course with five transformational parts across 99 meetings. Each part offers a guided container for inner practice, shared learning, and the unfolding of a deeper invitation.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-14 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-soft">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-brand-600">Course structure</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">99 meetings in five parts</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600">This journey is divided into five parts, each with a specific focus and rhythm. Together they form an integrated curriculum for embodiment, inquiry, devotion, and community.</p>
    </article>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      {% for part in parts %}
      <a href="#part-{{ part.id }}" class="block rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6 transition hover:border-brand-300 hover:bg-white">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-500">Part {{ part.id }}</p>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">{{ part.title }}</h3>
          </div>
          <span class="rounded-full bg-brand-100 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-700">{{ part.meetings }} meetings</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600">{{ part.description }}</p>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-16 space-y-8">
    {% for part in parts %}
    <section id="part-{{ part.id }}" class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-soft">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-600">Part {{ part.id }}</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">{{ part.title }}</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">{{ part.meetings }} meetings</p>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-5 text-slate-600">{{ part.longDescription }}</p>
    </section>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
